meta {
  name: Update Invitation
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{apiOrigin}}/admin/invitations/{{invitationId}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{adminSessionToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "guestGivenName": "An",
    "guestFamilyName": "Nguyễn"
  }
}

docs {
  Admin (#170). Every field is optional. Sending given/family names stores
  them as reviewed; sending only `guestName` re-splits it (unreviewed);
  `{ "nameReviewed": true }` confirms the current split. Lowering
  `maxPlusOnes` below the RSVP's plus-ones is 409. `adminSessionToken` is an
  HS256 JWT signed with ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET whose `sub` is an approved
  GitHub handle (secret var, never committed).
}
